{"data": {"acceptance": ["built_in_themes() returns the seven existing themes followed by midnight_studio, ember_night, nordic_slate, ink_and_paper, all with built_in True and schema-valid color roles", "Each new theme has one focused test asserting its exact ten color roles and display name, linked to a new Active UX requirement snapshot", "default_theme_id() still returns audiomancer_dark and existing theme tests stay green", "gates pass: uv run --directory 04_Software/AudioMancer pytest -q and uv run --directory 04_Software/AudioMancer ruff check ."], "assumptions": ["All four proposed themes are implemented, not a subset.", "New themes are appended after audiomancer_parchment so existing catalog order and combo-box indices for current themes are unchanged.", "The default theme stays audiomancer_dark; no settings migration is needed because an unknown selected_theme_id already self-heals to the default.", "settings_page builds the theme combo by iterating built_in_themes(), so no UI code change is required."], "created_at": "2026-07-26T21:15:04+00:00", "decision": "proceed", "open_questions": [], "planned_paths": ["04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/ui_theme_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_ui_theme_service.py"], "reason": "Purely additive presentation data behind an already-validated schema, no persisted-format or default-behavior change, and the Settings UI enumerates the catalog dynamically.", "recommended_responses": [], "risk": "low", "scope": ["04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/ui_theme_service.py, 04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_ui_theme_service.py, .agentic/requirements/ux/, .agentic/knowledge/components/Platform_Settings_UI.md"], "source": "Chat 2026-07-27: user reviewed four proposed themes and asked to start a run and implement them", "understanding": "Append four new built-in UI themes to the AudioMancer theme catalog - Midnight Studio (cool dark), Ember Night (warm low-blue-light dark), Nordic Slate (desaturated dark), and Ink and Paper (near-monochrome light) - as pure data entries in _BUILT_IN_THEMES, with no schema, default-theme, or Settings-page changes."}, "event": "alignment.recorded", "time": "2026-07-26T21:15:04+00:00"}
